            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Educational Contributions</strong><br>\nCassin also contributed to the advancement of legal education, helping to shape the minds of future legal professionals and human rights advocates.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Legacy and Honors</strong><br>\nRené Cassin's legacy is marked by his tireless work to establish legal standards for human rights. Many institutions and awards are named in his honor, reflecting his impact on the world.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Death and Ongoing Influence</strong><br>\nCassin passed away on February 20, 1976. His vision and contributions continue to influence international law and the ongoing fight for human dignity and rights.</p>\n"
              },
